1
00:00:00,831 --> 00:00:03,301
(Sheldon:)It's not a present.
It's the present.

2
00:00:03,467 --> 00:00:08,027
(Sheldon:)Look, there's you and me.
It's Penny and Amy.

3
00:00:08,205 --> 00:00:12,645
(Sheldon:)We're playing Pictionary, in the present.

4
00:00:16,814 --> 00:00:18,804
(Penny:)Oh, my God, we're gonna kill them.

5
00:00:21,419 --> 00:00:25,409
- It's a quark-gluon plasma.
- No.

6
00:00:25,923 --> 00:00:30,023
(Sheldon:)It's asymptotically free partons
inside a quark-gluon plasma.

7
00:00:30,428 --> 00:00:32,488
(Leonard:)Nothing with quarks.

8
00:00:32,997 --> 00:00:36,827
(Sheldon:)It's an observational rebuttal
of the Lambda-CDM model of the universe.

9
00:00:38,269 --> 00:00:40,239
(Sheldon:)- No.
- It's a chocolate chip cookie!

10
00:00:40,438 --> 00:00:41,908
Yes!

11
00:00:45,509 --> 00:00:47,269
- How could you miss that?
- Hey!

12
00:00:47,445 --> 00:00:49,935
(Sheldon:)If you want someone to guess
chocolate chip cookie...

13
00:00:50,147 --> 00:00:52,177
(Sheldon:)...you draw a glass of milk next to it.

14
00:00:53,384 --> 00:00:55,684
- Penny got it.
- Yeah, only after I eliminated...

15
00:00:55,853 --> 00:00:57,843
(Sheldon:)...all the obvious answers.

16
00:00:58,356 --> 00:01:02,026
(Sheldon:)You're welcome.

